    "detailed_description": "Get ready to enter the battlefield and engage in a high-speed action-packed war! This game offers an exhilarating gameplay with intense battles taking place in various environments such as the sky, outer space, forest and more. You will take control of your ship armed with rockets and face off against a fleet of enemy UFOs. With multiple levels to conquer, each one offering increasing challenges, you must use your reflexes and strategic skills to outmaneuver your opponents and reign supreme.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you ready to dominate the skies and emerge victorious in this epic war? Join the fight now and prove your skills in this action-packed adventure!",
